window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/hpc-v26-017-c825b3cbcf4c9f76.json"]={sha256:"c825b3cbcf4c9f7642fa3201e9b5973a56a600d91f354b81d9ada4ce7c08772a",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v26-case-d7f277d87e1f4f91","url":"https://docs.nersc.gov/systems/perlmutter/architecture/","title":"Perlmutter CPU architecture","titleEn":"Perlmutter CPU architecture","publisher":"NERSC","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v26-017","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v26-017","related":[{"id":"hpc-v26-018","referenceUrls":["https://docs.olcf.ornl.gov/systems/summit_user_guide.html"],"title":"POWER SMT：延遲隱藏與資源共享","titleEn":"POWER SMT: latency hiding and shared resources","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付頁面歸屬圖、first-touch實驗及延遲混合表；95/86重現，頁面與工作映射可追蹤，未以延遲平均預測所有快取行為；請另一位學徒依交付件重新推導一組；未通過或資料不足必須明記，不以品牌或峰值取代證據。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver page maps, first-touch experiments and latency mixtures. Reproduce 95/86 with traceable pages/work, without extending the average to all cache behavior. Have another learner derive one case from the handover; label failures or missing evidence without substituting brand names or peak rates.","difference":"把槽分成有用、等待、重做三色，記各硬體執行緒擁有者；不要把執行緒數當核心數；.45/.65與槽守恆成立，報告不將利用率直接當應用速度比。","differenceEn":"Color slots useful, waiting, replay and record thread owners; thread count is not core count. Verify 0.45/0.65 and slot conservation without equating utilization to application speedup.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["平均延遲L=p×Llocal+(1−p)×Lremote，假設存取可分別計數且無重疊；本地80ns、遠端140ns；本地比例p=.75，改善到.9；名義式 .75*80+.25*140 = 95 ns/access model；變更式 .9*80+.1*140 = 86 ns/access model。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","有用利用率U=有用發射槽/可用槽，等待與重做都不計有用；每次觀測1000槽，單執行緒有用450；雙執行緒合計有用650，含重做50槽另列；名義式 450/1000 = 0.45 useful utilization；變更式 650/1000 = 0.65 useful utilization。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Average latency L=pLlocal+(1−p)Lremote, assuming countable independent accesses with no overlap. Local 80 ns, remote 140 ns; local share 0.75 then 0.9. Nominal .75*80+.25*140 = 95 ns/access model; changed .9*80+.1*140 = 86 ns/access model. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","Useful utilization U=useful issued slots/available slots; waits and repeated work are excluded. Each observation has 1000 slots; one thread uses 450 usefully, two use 650, with 50 replay slots listed separately. Nominal 450/1000 = 0.45 useful utilization; changed 650/1000 = 0.65 useful utilization. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"hpc-v26-027","referenceUrls":["https://petsc.org/release/manual/mat/"],"title":"PETSc CSR SpMV：稀疏索引與零元素","titleEn":"PETSc CSR SpMV: sparse indices and omitted zeros","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付頁面歸屬圖、first-touch實驗及延遲混合表；95/86重現，頁面與工作映射可追蹤，未以延遲平均預測所有快取行為；請另一位學徒依交付件重新推導一組；未通過或資料不足必須明記，不以品牌或峰值取代證據。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver page maps, first-touch experiments and latency mixtures. Reproduce 95/86 with traceable pages/work, without extending the average to all cache behavior. Have another learner derive one case from the handover; label failures or missing evidence without substituting brand names or peak rates.","difference":"畫rowptr[0]=0、rowptr[1]=2與兩個非零；用稠密列[2,0,−1]對照；1/−1正確，rowptr單調、末值等於nnz且列索引在向量範圍。","differenceEn":"Draw rowptr [0] = 0 and rowptr [1] = 2 with two nonzero entries. Compare the dense row [2, 0, −1]. Verify 1/−1, monotonic rowptr, last=nnz and valid column bounds.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["平均延遲L=p×Llocal+(1−p)×Lremote，假設存取可分別計數且無重疊；本地80ns、遠端140ns；本地比例p=.75，改善到.9；名義式 .75*80+.25*140 = 95 ns/access model；變更式 .9*80+.1*140 = 86 ns/access model。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","CSR一列y_i=sum values[k]×x[col[k]]；rowptr界定半開區間，零可不儲存；第0列col=[0,2]、values=[2,−1]，x=[3,4,5]；將x2改7；名義式 2*3-1*5 = 1 y[0]；變更式 2*3-1*7 = -1 y[0]。數據與驗收門檻為原創教學情境，並非所列超級電腦或函式庫的實測規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Average latency L=pLlocal+(1−p)Lremote, assuming countable independent accesses with no overlap. Local 80 ns, remote 140 ns; local share 0.75 then 0.9. Nominal .75*80+.25*140 = 95 ns/access model; changed .9*80+.1*140 = 86 ns/access model. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","CSR row y_i sums values[k] x[col[k]] over a rowptr half-open interval; zeros may be omitted. Row 0 columns [0, 2], values [2, −1], x [3, 4, 5]; change x 2 to 7. Nominal 2*3-1*5 = 1 y[0]; changed 2*3-1*7 = -1 y[0]. Inputs and acceptance thresholds are original teaching scenarios, not measured specifications of the named systems or libraries.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v26-case-c9eab9c7f7058e67","url":"https://docs.olcf.ornl.gov/systems/summit_user_guide.html","title":"Summit hardware threads","titleEn":"Summit hardware threads","publisher":"Oak Ridge Leadership Computing Facility","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v26-case-8978b07967ce57e7","url":"https://petsc.org/release/manual/mat/","title":"PETSc matrices","titleEn":"PETSc matrices","publisher":"PETSc development team","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
